<title>POLAND: Elektrim buys Polish electrical firm.</title>
<headline>Elektrim buys Polish electrical firm.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish trading and industrial conglomerate Elektrim SA bought on Monday from the state treasury a 75 percent stake in electrical machinery maker Emit SA for 7.77 million zlotys, the treasury ministry said.</p>
